  "worked_solution": "The elements of the given set are the integers that satisfy the equation $5n+25=10.$ \n\nSo, we first need to solve our equation for $n:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5n+25 & =10 \\\\ 5n & =-15 \\\\ n & =-3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe solution is $n=-3,$ which is an integer.\n\nTherefore, we can write the given set as\n\n$$\nA={-3}.\n$$",
